* Hidden full-rate transfer bench: the eight code centers, inputs 0.3 LSB either side of every threshold, each
* reached from a code on the other side of that threshold (most from two or more codes away), full-scale jumps
* and the code 3 / code 4 transition both ways, and out-of-range inputs (0.4 V and 3.0 V) reached from the far end.
* expected codes (conversions 0..29, first 2 are warm-up): 0 7 3 4 5 0 7 5 1 3 6 1 5 2 7 0 2 4 2 6 0 7 0 7 6 4 3 7 0 1
.include "/opt/gf180/pdk/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/xyce/design.xyce"
.lib "/opt/gf180/pdk/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/xyce/sm141064.xyce" typical
.include "/app/circuit.spi"
.options device temp=27
VSS vss 0 0
VSUP vdd vss 3.3
VRP vrefp_s vss 2.6
RRP vrefp_s vrefp 10
VRN vrefn_s vss 1.0
RRN vrefn_s vrefn 10
VCK clk_s vss PULSE(0 3.3 10n 0.3n 0.3n 9.4n 20n)
RCK clk_s clk 50
VSIG vin_s vss PWL(0 1.10
+ 20n 1.10 20.2n 2.50
+ 40n 2.50 40.2n 1.70
+ 60n 1.70 60.2n 1.90
+ 80n 1.90 80.2n 2.10
+ 100n 2.10 100.2n 1.14
+ 120n 1.14 120.2n 2.46
+ 140n 2.46 140.2n 2.14
+ 160n 2.14 160.2n 1.30
+ 180n 1.30 180.2n 1.66
+ 200n 1.66 200.2n 2.26
+ 220n 2.26 220.2n 1.34
+ 240n 1.34 240.2n 2.06
+ 260n 2.06 260.2n 1.54
+ 280n 1.54 280.2n 3.00
+ 300n 3.00 300.2n 0.40
+ 320n 0.40 320.2n 1.46
+ 340n 1.46 340.2n 1.86
+ 360n 1.86 360.2n 1.50
+ 380n 1.50 380.2n 2.30
+ 400n 2.30 400.2n 1.10
+ 420n 1.10 420.2n 2.50
+ 440n 2.50 440.2n 1.10
+ 460n 1.10 460.2n 3.00
+ 480n 3.00 480.2n 2.34
+ 500n 2.34 500.2n 1.94
+ 520n 1.94 520.2n 1.74
+ 540n 1.74 540.2n 2.50
+ 560n 2.50 560.2n 0.40
+ 580n 0.40 580.2n 1.26)
RSIG vin_s vin 50
XADC vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0 flash_adc_3bit
CB2 b2 vss 50f
CB1 b1 vss 50f
CB0 b0 vss 50f

.tran 50p 611n 0 0.2n
* the grader reads Xyce's raw file (every node and source current); this line is for your own plots
.print tran format=csv v(clk) v(vin) v(b2) v(b1) v(b0)
.end
